    narr:narration """Dave Quantum has initiated a [strategic migration of the analytics pipeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_1), moving from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB. This shift is framed through a [dual-justification of performance and cost](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_2), specifically targeting a 10x improvement in query speed. The transition is [formally scheduled for Q3 2026](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_5), with the decision and its expected outcomes codified into [official project documentation](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_3). The voice profile here is characterized by a high-conviction, decisive register that prioritizes technical efficiency and market-based rationales.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787304049763_1> ;
